  (text "J1 (9V_DC_IN): Wire to a 2.1 mm DC jack: sleeve -> pin 1 (+9V), centre pin -> pin 2 (GND). Pedal standard = centre negative.\nD1 (SS34): Reverse polarity protection: blocks current if the adapter is wrong\nC1 (100uF 25V): Bulk supply reservoir\nC2, C5 (100nF): Ceramic capacitor\nU1 (L78M05): 9 V -> 5 V regulator, 500 mA\nC3 (1uF): Regulator input cap\nC4 (10uF): Regulator output cap\nD2 (SS14): Feeds the Black Pill 5V pin. Stops USB power flowing back into our 5 V rail\nU2 (AP2112K-3.3): 5 V -> 3.3 V clean supply for the audio converters\nC6 (1uF): Ceramic capacitor\nC7 (10uF): Ceramic capacitor\nFB1 (600R@100MHz): Ferrite bead: keeps digital noise off the ADC's analog 5 V\nR1 (10k): Bias divider top\nR2 (10k): Bias divider bottom\nC8 (47uF 25V): Makes VBIAS a quiet 'AC ground' at half supply"
    (at 12 102.4 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "5ffae172-b0dd-573a-b5db-52f826a92eba"))
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/"
      (page "2"))))
